WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.850
The core systemic failure is not that intelligence agencies didn't know.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.575
CSIS knew.

00:00:06.575 --> 00:00:15.000
The failure occurred in the pipeline between intelligence and action; the warnings did not consistently reach decision makers in time to act.
